# Test content is byte-exact by contract: archived builds must stay
# byte-identical to the committed blobs they came from (archive-testdata.js
# verifies provenance with a byte compare), so no checkout may ever smudge
# them to CRLF. -text disables all line-ending conversion in BOTH directions
# for these paths, on every machine, regardless of core.autocrlf.
testdata/** -text
